  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 200 SOLID WASTE PROGRAM: PROCEDURES",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Env-Sw 200 SOLID WASTE PROGRAM: PROCEDURES\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 149-M:7\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #8461-B, effective 10-28-05, adopted Part Env-Sw 201, readopted with amendments and renumbered as Part Env-Sw 202 through Part Env-Sw 203 the rules in former Part Env-Wm 202 through Part Env-Wm 203 that had contained procedural rules on solid waste management in the areas of applicability, waivers, confidentiality, and non-adjudicative public hearings.\n\nDocument #8461-C, effective 10-28-05, readopted with amendments and renumbered as Part Env-Sw 204 and Part Env-Sw 205 the former Part Env-Wm 204 and Part Env-Wm 205 that had contained procedural rules on solid waste management in the areas, respectively, of non-adjudicative public hearings and adjudicative hearings.\n\nDocument #8461-B and Document #8461-C replace all prior filings for procedural rules on solid waste formerly in Chapter Env-Wm 200. The redesignation from subtitle Env-Wm to Env-Sw was done pursuant to a rules reorganization plan for Department rules approved by the Director of the Office of Legislative Services on 9-7-05.\n\nThe prior filings for the former procedural rules in Env-Wm 200 on solid waste include the following documents:\n\n#5172, eff 7-1-91\n\n#6535, INTERIM, eff 7-1-97\n\n#6619-B, eff 10-29-97\n\n#7225, eff 3-31-00",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw200.html"
